{
  "info": {
    "name": "CampusReservas (demo simple)",
    "description": "La demo corta, sin environment: usuario1 reserva y admin1 aprueba el evento.\n\n1. Levantá el sistema: `sh build.sh` y `docker compose up -d --build`.\n2. Clic derecho en la colección → Run collection → Run.\n\nLos tokens se piden y se renuevan solos, y las fechas se calculan solas. La demo completa, con todas las reglas, está en CampusReservas.postman_collection.json.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{token_usuario1}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "// Corre antes de cada pedido.",
          "// 1. dia: el próximo día hábil a 2 o más días (hora de la máquina)",
          "const d = new Date(); d.setDate(d.getDate() + 2);",
          "while (d.getDay() === 0 || d.getDay() === 6) d.setDate(d.getDate() + 1);",
          "pm.variables.set(\"dia\", d.getFullYear() + \"-\" + String(d.getMonth() + 1).padStart(2, \"0\") + \"-\" + String(d.getDate()).padStart(2, \"0\"));",
          "",
          "// 2. Si un token venció (duran 5 minutos), pedir uno nuevo, para que no se corte con un 401",
          "[\"usuario1\", \"admin1\"].forEach(usuario => {",
          "    if (Date.now() < Number(pm.collectionVariables.get(\"vence_\" + usuario) || 0)) return;",
          "    pm.sendRequest({",
          "        url: pm.collectionVariables.get(\"keycloak\") + \"/realms/campus/protocol/openid-connect/token\",",
          "        method: \"POST\",",
          "        header: { \"Content-Type\": \"application/x-www-form-urlencoded\" },",
          "        body: {",
          "            mode: \"urlencoded\",",
          "            urlencoded: [",
          "                { key: \"grant_type\", value: \"password\" },",
          "                { key: \"client_id\", value: \"campus-api\" },",
          "                { key: \"username\", value: usuario },",
          "                { key: \"password\", value: usuario }",
          "            ]",
          "        }",
          "    }, (err, res) => {",
          "        if (err || res.code !== 200) return;",
          "        const t = res.json();",
          "        pm.collectionVariables.set(\"token_\" + usuario, t.access_token);",
          "        pm.collectionVariables.set(\"vence_\" + usuario, Date.now() + (t.expires_in - 30) * 1000);",
          "    });",
          "});"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "gateway",
      "value": "http://localhost:8080"
    },
    {
      "key": "keycloak",
      "value": "http://localhost:8180"
    },
    {
      "key": "token_usuario1",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "vence_usuario1",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "token_admin1",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "vence_admin1",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "reserva_clase",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "reserva_evento",
      "value": ""
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Login usuario1",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "const t = pm.response.json();",
              "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"token_usuario1\", t.access_token);",
              "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"vence_usuario1\", Date.now() + (t.expires_in - 30) * 1000);",
              "pm.test(\"Trae un access_token\", () => pm.expect(t.access_token).to.be.a(\"string\").and.not.empty);"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [],
        "url": "{{keycloak}}/realms/campus/protocol/openid-connect/token",
        "description": "usuario1 pide su JWT a Keycloak. Queda en {{token_usuario1}} y es el que usan todos los pedidos, salvo los de admin1.",
        "body": {
          "mode": "urlencoded",
          "urlencoded": [
            {
              "key": "grant_type",
              "value": "password"
            },
            {
              "key": "client_id",
              "value": "campus-api"
            },
            {
              "key": "username",
              "value": "usuario1"
            },
            {
              "key": "password",
              "value": "usuario1"
            }
          ]
        },
        "auth": {
          "type": "noauth"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Login admin1",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "const t = pm.response.json();",
              "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"token_admin1\", t.access_token);",
              "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"vence_admin1\", Date.now() + (t.expires_in - 30) * 1000);",
              "pm.test(\"Trae un access_token\", () => pm.expect(t.access_token).to.be.a(\"string\").and.not.empty);"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [],
        "url": "{{keycloak}}/realms/campus/protocol/openid-connect/token",
        "description": "admin1 pide su JWT. Queda en {{token_admin1}}: lo usan solo los pedidos que dicen admin1 (ver y aprobar eventos).",
        "body": {
          "mode": "urlencoded",
          "urlencoded": [
            {
              "key": "grant_type",
              "value": "password"
            },
            {
              "key": "client_id",
              "value": "campus-api"
            },
            {
              "key": "username",
              "value": "admin1"
            },
            {
              "key": "password",
              "value": "admin1"
            }
          ]
        },
        "auth": {
          "type": "noauth"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "3. Ver los espacios",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "pm.test(\"Hay espacios\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().responseValue).to.not.be.empty);"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": "{{gateway}}/api/espacios",
        "description": "El catálogo: los 5 espacios de prueba."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "4. Ver el Aula 101",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "pm.test(\"Es el Aula 101\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().responseValue.nombre).to.eql(\"Aula 101\"));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": "{{gateway}}/api/espacios/1",
        "description": "El detalle de un espacio: capacidad 40, con proyector, de 8 a 22."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "5. Buscar dónde dar una clase",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "const ids = pm.response.json().responseValue.map(e => e.id);",
              "pm.test(\"Aparece el Aula 101\", () => pm.expect(ids).to.include(1));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": "{{gateway}}/api/reservas/disponibilidad?inicio={{dia}}T14:00:00&fin={{dia}}T16:00:00&asistentes=30&actividad=CLASE&equipamiento=PROYECTOR",
        "description": "Clase con proyector para 30 personas, de 14 a 16: aparece el Aula 101."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "6. Reservar el Aula 101 → CONFIRMADA",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"HTTP 201\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
              "const r = pm.response.json().responseValue || {};",
              "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"reserva_clase\", r.id || 0);",
              "pm.test(\"CONFIRMADA\", () => pm.expect(r.estado).to.eql(\"CONFIRMADA\"));",
              "pm.test(\"A nombre de usuario1\", () => pm.expect(r.usuario).to.eql(\"usuario1\"));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": "{{gateway}}/api/reservas",
        "description": "Una clase queda CONFIRMADA en el acto, a nombre de usuario1 (el gateway saca el usuario del token).",
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"espacioId\": 1,\n  \"inicio\": \"{{dia}}T14:00:00\",\n  \"fin\": \"{{dia}}T16:00:00\",\n  \"asistentes\": 30,\n  \"actividad\": \"CLASE\",\n  \"equipamiento\": [\n    \"PROYECTOR\"\n  ]\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "7. Reservarla otra vez → 409 (ya está ocupada)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"HTTP 409\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(409));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": "{{gateway}}/api/reservas",
        "description": "La misma franja en el mismo espacio: se superpone con la reserva anterior (RN6).",
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"espacioId\": 1,\n  \"inicio\": \"{{dia}}T14:00:00\",\n  \"fin\": \"{{dia}}T16:00:00\",\n  \"asistentes\": 30,\n  \"actividad\": \"CLASE\",\n  \"equipamiento\": [\n    \"PROYECTOR\"\n  ]\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "8. 50 personas en un aula para 40 → 422",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"HTTP 422\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(422));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": "{{gateway}}/api/reservas",
        "description": "Supera la capacidad del espacio (RN5).",
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"espacioId\": 1,\n  \"inicio\": \"{{dia}}T16:00:00\",\n  \"fin\": \"{{dia}}T17:00:00\",\n  \"asistentes\": 50,\n  \"actividad\": \"CLASE\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "9. Reserva de 15 minutos → 422",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"HTTP 422\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(422));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": "{{gateway}}/api/reservas",
        "description": "Las reservas duran entre 30 minutos y 4 horas (RN2).",
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"espacioId\": 1,\n  \"inicio\": \"{{dia}}T17:00:00\",\n  \"fin\": \"{{dia}}T17:15:00\",\n  \"asistentes\": 10,\n  \"actividad\": \"CLASE\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "10. Pedir un evento → PENDIENTE",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"HTTP 201\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
              "const r = pm.response.json().responseValue || {};",
              "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"reserva_evento\", r.id || 0);",
              "pm.test(\"PENDIENTE\", () => pm.expect(r.estado).to.eql(\"PENDIENTE\"));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": "{{gateway}}/api/reservas",
        "description": "Un EVENTO no se confirma solo: queda PENDIENTE hasta que lo apruebe un ADMIN (RN13).",
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"espacioId\": 1,\n  \"inicio\": \"{{dia}}T18:00:00\",\n  \"fin\": \"{{dia}}T20:00:00\",\n  \"asistentes\": 30,\n  \"actividad\": \"EVENTO\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "11. admin1 ve los pendientes",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "const ids = pm.response.json().responseValue.map(r => r.id);",
              "pm.test(\"Está el evento del paso 10\", () => pm.expect(ids).to.include(Number(pm.collectionVariables.get(\"reserva_evento\"))));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": "{{gateway}}/api/reservas?estado=PENDIENTE",
        "description": "La bandeja del administrador: los eventos que esperan aprobación. Está el del paso 10.",
        "auth": {
          "type": "bearer",
          "bearer": [
            {
              "key": "token",
              "value": "{{token_admin1}}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "12. admin1 aprueba el evento → CONFIRMADA",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "pm.test(\"CONFIRMADA\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().responseValue.estado).to.eql(\"CONFIRMADA\"));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "PATCH",
        "header": [],
        "url": "{{gateway}}/api/reservas/{{reserva_evento}}/aprobar",
        "description": "El administrador lo aprueba y pasa a CONFIRMADA.",
        "auth": {
          "type": "bearer",
          "bearer": [
            {
              "key": "token",
              "value": "{{token_admin1}}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "13. Mis reservas",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "const mias = pm.response.json().responseValue;",
              "const estado = id => (mias.find(r => r.id === Number(pm.collectionVariables.get(id))) || {}).estado;",
              "pm.test(\"La clase está CONFIRMADA\", () => pm.expect(estado(\"reserva_clase\")).to.eql(\"CONFIRMADA\"));",
              "pm.test(\"El evento aprobado está CONFIRMADA\", () => pm.expect(estado(\"reserva_evento\")).to.eql(\"CONFIRMADA\"));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": "{{gateway}}/api/reservas/mias",
        "description": "Las reservas de usuario1: la clase y el evento, los dos CONFIRMADA."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "14. Cancelar la clase → CANCELADA",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "pm.test(\"CANCELADA\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().responseValue.estado).to.eql(\"CANCELADA\"));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "PATCH",
        "header": [],
        "url": "{{gateway}}/api/reservas/{{reserva_clase}}/cancelar",
        "description": "usuario1 cancela su clase."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "15. Cancelar el evento → CANCELADA",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "pm.test(\"CANCELADA\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().responseValue.estado).to.eql(\"CANCELADA\"));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "PATCH",
        "header": [],
        "url": "{{gateway}}/api/reservas/{{reserva_evento}}/cancelar",
        "description": "usuario1 cancela también el evento. El aula queda libre, así que la colección se puede volver a correr."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "16. Sin token → 401",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"HTTP 401\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(401));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": "{{gateway}}/api/espacios",
        "description": "Sin JWT, el gateway no deja pasar.",
        "auth": {
          "type": "noauth"
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
